; M26 - The Maelstrom: open water inside a storm wall, one ship, no islands.
;
; Isolation by construction (requirements.md Requirement 2):
; - the root is named "Maelstrom", not "World", so SaveManager never autosaves
;   and ResourceManager's economy tick never runs during a run;
; - the spawner lives at Run/EnemySpawner, not Systems/EnemySpawner, so
;   CampaignManager and SeasonalEventManager never connect to its kills;
; - there is no WorldHUD (campaign-wired) and no Systems/ node at all.

